{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_serious.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "芬姐，你嗰本更紙先至係寶嚟，成個廠邊個開工邊個收工，都喺你嗰幾版紙入面。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "做"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "做咗十幾年副導演喇，咩人未見過。啲後生入嚟嗰陣個個都話要紅，我就睇佢哋捱唔捱到第三年。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_serious.webp", "line": "你"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_serious.webp", "line": "你唔同，你肯做啲冇人想做嘅嘢，又唔多聲氣。呢種人，個廠先會記住。"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "芬姐，"}
{"phase": "s_fen_intro", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "story", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "extra_ad_fen_base.webp", "line": "芬姐，你咁講，我會驕傲㗎。"}
